### Phase 14: metrics, traces, logs.
### UIs: Grafana http://localhost:3000 (admin / GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD), Jaeger http://localhost:16686,
###      Prometheus http://localhost:9090 (targets, alerts)
### Token: ./infrastructure/keycloak/pkce-login.sh alice 2>/dev/null

@gw = http://localhost:8080
@alice = paste-alice-token
@aliceAccount = paste-an-alice-account-id
@bobsNumber = paste-a-bob-account-number

### 1. A transfer. Look at the response header X-Trace-Id, then open it in Jaeger (request 6)
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 1.00 }

### 2. An error also has an X-Trace-Id (401 from the gateway itself)
GET {{gw}}/api/accounts

### 3. Metrics as Prometheus scrapes them (no token needed; never routed through the gateway)
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/prometheus

### 4. PromQL: transfers by outcome in the last 5 minutes
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=sum by (status) (increase(banking_transfer_seconds_count[5m]))

### 5. Alerts and their state (inactive / pending / firing)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/alerts

### 6. One trace from Jaeger (paste the X-Trace-Id from request 1)
GET http://localhost:16686/api/traces/paste-a-trace-id

### 7. Is the outbox keeping up?
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=banking_outbox_oldest_age_seconds
